# Office supplies

This **small document** has prose, a calculating table and an included note.

- Keep the source readable.
- Save formulas rather than their results.

:::table name="budget"
| "Item" | "Quantity" | "Price" | "Total" |
| "Pens" | 12 | 2.5 | =B1*C1 |
| "Paper" | 2 | 5 | =B2*C2 |
| "Total" | | | =sum(D1:D2) |
:::

The total is calculated in the table above.

